/*
 * Hartwick Atelier — PRODUCT PAGE
 * Built to Wireframe (03) PRODUCT PAGE (desktop + mobile) and the mobile
 * developer brief "HA_ Wireframe 03_ Mobile Product Page".
 *
 * Section order is the brief's hierarchy and is the same at both breakpoints:
 *   garment image -> purchase -> the garment -> material record -> origin ->
 *   masters -> process -> care/delivery -> journal -> related -> The Register.
 * "I do not want a visitor to travel through the Masters, provenance and
 * Journal content before they can select a size or add the garment to the
 * bag." (brief §3)
 *
 * Native wherever Luxe can carry the design: the gallery, the whole product
 * form, the popups, the accordions and the recommendations are all Shopify's
 * own. Custom only where a metafield-driven record is required.
 *
 * All placeholder copy below is wireframe copy, clearly marked on screen, and
 * switches to real data the moment the hartwick.* definitions and content exist.
 * Nothing here asserts an unverified fact as fact (CLAUDE.md, risk R7).
 *
 * ------------------------------------------------------------
 * NOTE: this file is also written by the Shopify theme editor.
 * ------------------------------------------------------------
 */
